<title>SINGAPORE: Ho Wah Genting 1996 loss deepens.</title>
<headline>Ho Wah Genting 1996 loss deepens.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss			    2.98   vs    2.71</p>
<p>    Loss per share (cents)	  9.60   vs    8.78</p>
<p>    Turnover			    7.92   vs   20.64</p>
<p>    Interest expense		  0.44   vs    1.37</p>
<p>    Depreciation			1.48   vs    2.18</p>
<p>    Pre-tax loss			2.92   vs    4.02</p>
<p>    Tax				   0.06   vs    0.41</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	 (gain)  0.88   vs    0.50</p>
<p>Note - Ho Wah Genting International Ltd said gains from the disposal of two of its subsidiaries helped reduce its loss.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
